 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Nora planned her five-park road trip around one number: gas.",
   "start": 0.25,
   "end": 3.914
  },
  {
   "text": "Then came entrance fees, campsites, a motel when it poured, and food in pricey park towns.",
   "start": 4.114,
   "end": 9.961
  },
  {
   "text": "By day four, her budget was gone.",
   "start": 10.161,
   "end": 12.177
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix.",
   "start": 12.477,
   "end": 13.404
  },
  {
   "text": "Before you book anything, cost out every day:",
   "start": 13.654,
   "end": 16.015
  },
  {
   "text": "miles and fuel, entrance or pass, a bed, food, plus one spare line for surprises.",
   "start": 16.165,
   "end": 21.911
  },
  {
   "text": "Visiting several parks this year? Compare an annual pass with single entry fees.",
   "start": 22.161,
   "end": 26.984
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this while you plan your trip.",
   "start": 27.334,
   "end": 29.022
  }
 ],
